# Hormozi X Desk (mandatory) — SPCL · Qual · Trust

**Old Twitter loop is RETIRED.** Do not run Pulse→Learn→Coach→Researcher→Strategist→Editor as religion.

Read end-to-end every run:
1. `TWITTER.md` (Hormozi OS)
2. `twitter_agents/researcher/knowledge/hormozi_spcl.md`
3. `twitter_agents/researcher/knowledge/hormozi_qual_algorithm.md`
4. `twitter_agents/SHARED/brand_seed.md` (voice + bans only)

**Never auto-publish.**

## The only pipeline

```
Spine → SPCL stamp plan → Stuff (live receipts) → Craft → Soft ask in SR → Qual delete → Stage
```

| Step | Job |
|------|-----|
| Spine | Dale dump or live board moment |
| SPCL | Name Status · Power · Credibility · Likeness stamps + the ask |
| Stuff | Numbers/screens from THIS run — whole truth |
| Craft | Line 1 = visible S/C; body pays promise; Dale likeness |
| Ask | Soft trial + link **self-reply only** |
| Qual | Delete fluff; ship 95%; majors ≠ minors |
| Stage | `COPY_PASTE` / compose links — Dale posts |

## Algorithm on the process itself

Question requirements → delete until add-back → simplify → accelerate → **automate last**.  
Elimination > automation. AI limus = more compliance/trials/money, not more tokens.

## Non-negotiables (trust)

- Live numbers only
- Lock discipline (~15 min)
- Whole truth (W and L)
- No tipster theater / system-label leak
- Never auto-publish

## Dale spine law

If Dale provides the hook/angle, that is authorship. Shape it. Don’t invent a competing feltMoment.

